{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "24", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "12", "M": "22", "S": "12"}}, "news": [{"title": "Goa: Development in eco fragile land, tenants issue spark Mandur gram sabha", "para": "During the recent Azossim-Mandur gram sabha meeting, attendees addressed the proposed large-scale project on Azossim hill and its potential environmental consequences. Discussions also included tenant management and issues surrounding littering in rental properties. A controversial new road route through a verdant forest was debated, alongside occupancy certificates issued previously. The sarpanch committed to tackling the deteriorating Pilar-Old Goa road and the necessary BMC reconstitution.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/goa-development-in-eco-fragile-land-tenants-issue-spark-mandur-gram-sabha/133460084?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-320530/133460084.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Delhi development body to hold over 20 meetings in three months over MPD 2047", "para": "The Delhi Development Authority is gearing up for more than twenty stakeholder meetings in the near future. These critical dialogues will hone in on executing the Master Plan for Delhi 2047, welcoming contributions from elected officials, governmental organizations, industry representatives, and local residents alike. Furthermore, updates to the Delhi Development Act are set to support the swift rollout of the land pooling policy.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/delhi-development-body-to-hold-over-20-meetings-in-three-months-over-mpd-2047/133460049?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-72284/133460049.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}, {"title": "Smartworks adds \u20b9235 crore contracted rental revenue from client expansions", "para": "Smartworks has added about \u20b9235 crore of incremental contracted rental revenue through expansion mandates from existing enterprise clients. The revenue is in addition to the company\u2019s \u20b95,400 crore contracted rental revenue base as of June 30, 2026.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/smartworks-adds-235-crore-contracted-rental-revenue-from-client-expansions/133460320?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-145498/133460320.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}]}